{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536680/extras/6c06162d6e5bbd5dd125aaa9c8ddaa69.poster.avif?t=1770063088\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536680/extras/6c06162d6e5bbd5dd125aaa9c8ddaa69.webm?t=1770063088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536680/extras/6c06162d6e5bbd5dd125aaa9c8ddaa69.mp4?t=1770063088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore, join forces or fight your way through perilous magical PvPvE domains. Loot powerful items and extract them to craft your own unique playstyle.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536680/extras/175bd7d57ba2a8978bf6e7acb6b8d091.avif?t=1770063088\" width=616 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting in is only half the battle - you must get out alive! Explore deserts, snowlands, prisons and other magical landscapes while facing all kinds of threats\u00a0 in the world of wYzards. The only way to keep your loot is to escape through the portal before time or your HP runs out. If you perish, you lose it all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536680/extras/4879dd60d6df153c5143dbce1ac5eacf.poster.avif?t=1770063088\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536680/extras/4879dd60d6df153c5143dbce1ac5eacf.webm?t=1770063088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536680/extras/4879dd60d6df153c5143dbce1ac5eacf.mp4?t=1770063088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536680/extras/4d9d44d820e5dc839a30cf0495984103.avif?t=1770063088\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of mages with different elemental magic spells. Engage in a dynamic-strategic combat while harnessing spells of fire, water, earth, air, light, and darkness. Deal damage, heal allies, buff your stats. It's your deck, your strategy!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536680/extras/590ac01ac6d90369a17c133f9796aa8e.poster.avif?t=1770063088\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536680/extras/590ac01ac6d90369a17c133f9796aa8e.webm?t=1770063088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536680/extras/590ac01ac6d90369a17c133f9796aa8e.mp4?t=1770063088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536680/extras/bae1af9dd7a86abca9b9d216bdb5d08a.avif?t=1770063088\" width=616 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dangerous PvPvE environments when you test your elemental skills while searching diverse maps for items! Team up with fellow mages on multiplayer for survival or face every threat alone by going solo and testing your luck. No matter what strategy you choose, just remember to keep the portal in mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536680/extras/54b626bac90f520cc60bedcb95d46a11.poster.avif?t=1770063088\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536680/extras/54b626bac90f520cc60bedcb95d46a11.webm?t=1770063088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536680/extras/54b626bac90f520cc60bedcb95d46a11.mp4?t=1770063088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time is running out - Secure your loot, the portal awaits you.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3536680?t=1770063088","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536680/7a063a309798d96892cb892a9c24eb417fa1afd5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770063088","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536680/acc6163a8d114dfa3032357cd11d11965d614d92/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770063088","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536680/acc6163a8d114dfa3032357cd11d11965d614d92/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770063088","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536680/extras/6c06162d6e5bbd5dd125aaa9c8ddaa69.poster.avif?t=1770063088\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536680/extras/6c06162d6e5bbd5dd125aaa9c8ddaa69.webm?t=1770063088\" ty